Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 12:19:08 +0330
Subject: [PATCH] feat(shop): standard tabs and always-visible service
 selection
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rename the first tab to 'خریدها' and align all four tab labels exactly
centered with uniform height and padding. Replace the location dropdown
with a directly visible FlowRow grid of service categories (icon, full
name, clear selected state) so the buyer sees every service type on
entry; categories and durations become centered chip rows. Guard the
initial checkout launch so a failed activity start surfaces a message
instead of leaving the user stuck.
